      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "champ_0270_rival_17",
      "hash64": "0D4592CEA0DE2A50",
      "text": "咦～？\\n更适合我们的地方？\\r\\n……是哪儿呢？[VAR 0x0100(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
