      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "champ_0270_chairman_06",
      "hash64": "02FA6E0BAA6F8EB5",
      "text": "两个人能够互相尊敬。\\n……真是让人羡慕的关系啊。[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
